{"ref":"character:alucard","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alucard is a playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. His starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Alucart_Sworb.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:alucart-sworb"}," ",{"t":"Alucart Sworb","r":"weapon:alucart-sworb"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Unlocking and using the ",{"i":"Sprite-Morning_Star.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:morning-star"}," ",{"t":"Morning Star","r":"weapon:morning-star"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Coat_of_Arms.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:coat-of-arms"}," ",{"t":"Coat of Arms","r":"weapon:coat-of-arms"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Spectral_Sword.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spectral-sword"}," ",{"t":"Spectral Sword","r":"weapon:spectral-sword"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Belnades'_Spellbook.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"}," ",{"t":"Belnades' Spellbook","r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Ebony_Diabologue.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:ebony-diabologue"}," ",{"t":"Ebony Diabologue","r":"weapon:ebony-diabologue"}," will unlock the ",{"i":"Sprite-Candybox.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:candybox"}," ",{"t":"Candybox","r":"weapon:candybox"}," as an alternate starting weapon via ",{"i":"Sprite-Mindbender.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:mindbender"}," ",{"t":"skin selection","r":"relic:mindbender"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_ALUCARD"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Alucard_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Alucart_Sworb.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:alucart-sworb"}," ",{"t":"Alucart Sworb","r":"weapon:alucart-sworb"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Defeat the Doppelganger with Trevor Belmont."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 1,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Daniele_Zandara.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Dracula's Castle - Vampire Survivors\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["200"]]},{"label":"Armor","cells":[["+2"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+50%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Alucard can be unlocked by defeating the ",{"i":"Sprite-Zi'Assunta_Belpaese.png","w":24,"h":24}," Doppelganger, located in the Art Gallery on the ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"}," map, with ",{"i":"Sprite-Trevor_Belmont.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:trevor-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Trevor Belmont","r":"character:trevor-belmont"},". He can then be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 1,000, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Alucard can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"adrianfahrenheit\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Alucard starts with +100 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," and +50% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},". He is immune to health drain."]},{"k":"p","c":["He can also trigger various hidden weapons when meeting specific conditions:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Standing still will trigger ",{"i":"Sprite-Soul_Steal.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:soul-steal"}," ",{"t":"Soul Steal","r":"weapon:soul-steal"}," via a Charge, with a charge time of 30 s."]},{"c":["Upon levelling up, he will trigger ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Anger.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-anger"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Anger","r":"weapon:dominus-anger"},"."]},{"c":["When overhealing by +8, he will trigger ",{"i":"Sprite-Summon_Spirit.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:summon-spirit"}," ",{"t":"Summon Spirit","r":"weapon:summon-spirit"},"."]},{"c":["Upon reaching a critically low health, being 20% of his max health, Alucard will trigger ",{"i":"Sprite-Sword_Brothers.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sword-brothers"}," ",{"t":"Sword Brothers","r":"weapon:sword-brothers"},". This can only be triggered again after full healing. Fatal damage that defeats Alucard will not trigger this effect."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Alucard can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Alucard.png","w":120,"h":110,"c":["Alucard's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Alucard_(Idle).gif","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Idle animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":120,"h":102,"c":["Movement animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Alucard_(Magic_Attack).gif","w":120,"h":111,"c":["Magic attack animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Alucard_(Melee_Attack).gif","w":120,"h":77,"c":["Melee attack animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Alucard_(Ranged_Attack).gif","w":120,"h":102,"c":["Ranged attack animation"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Alucard_-_trailer.png","w":240,"h":225,"c":["Alucard as seen in the ",{"t":"pre-release trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aGAlK-DIeAE"}," of Ode to Castlevania."]},{"i":"Ode_to_Castlevania_short_-_Alucard_sheet.jpg","w":300,"h":153,"c":["Official Ode to Castlevania pre-release trailer model sheet.[1]"]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Soul Steal, Dark Inferno, Summon Spirit and Sword Brothers are all spells that Alucard can use in Symphony of the Night."]},{"c":["Alucard has a special attack animation when using the ",{"i":"Sprite-Fire_Wand.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:fire-wand"}," ",{"t":"Fire Wand","r":"weapon:fire-wand"},", lifting his cape like he does when using the Hellfire and Dark Inferno spells in Symphony of the Night."]},{"c":["The spell \"adrianfahrenheit\" is a reference to his real name, Adrian Fahrenheit Tepes."]},{"c":["Alucard's pose in the selection menu changes when altering his starting weapon. He is shown mid-walk when the ",{"i":"Sprite-Candybox.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:candybox"}," ",{"t":"Candybox","r":"weapon:candybox"}," is selected."]},{"c":["Alucard is one of the few characters with animated idle sprites."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"references","title":"References","blocks":[{"k":"ol","items":[{"c":[{"t":"@onasugar","x":"https://x.com/onasugar/status/1854591066101498151"}," at X (November 07, 2024)."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Alucard","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Alucard"}," at the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}